# Purser UI — runtime configuration (Vite env vars, baked at build time).
# Copy to `.env.local` to override. All are OPTIONAL: with none set, the UI runs
# against the in-memory mock so `npm run build`/`dev` work with no server.

# Backend mode. Unset (or anything but the values below) => mock (default).
# Set to 0/false/off/no to use the REAL HTTP client.
# VITE_PURSER_MOCK=0

# Control-plane management API base (same origin by default).
# VITE_PURSER_API_BASE=/api/v1

# OpenAI-compatible Gateway base for the Playground. May live on another
# host/port than the control plane that serves this UI.
# VITE_PURSER_GATEWAY_BASE=/v1
# VITE_PURSER_GATEWAY_BASE=https://gateway.internal:8443/v1
